<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Your Divorce Angel - Guidance, clarity, and confidence every step of the way.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Your Divorce Angel organizes your complete financial picture, runs real settlement scenarios, and prepares you for every negotiation.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;background:#fff;color:#1A2A35;font-size:20px;line-height:1.8;}

/* ── NAV ── */
.nav-logo-bar{background:white;width:100%;padding:14px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:101;border-bottom:1px solid #EDF4F8;box-sizing:border-box;}
.nav-logo{height:68px;mix-blend-mode:multiply;display:block;}

.nav{background:#9DCBE4;width:100%;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 36px;position:sticky;top:100px;z-index:99;}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:36px;font-size:19px;flex:1;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-right:0;}
.nav-links a{color:white;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.nav-links a:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:40px;padding:56px 48px 52px;align-items:start;max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;}
.hero-eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.04px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FAACB;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.hero h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.12;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:22px;}
.hero h1 em{color:#6FAACB;font-style:italic;}
.hero-p{font-size:21px;color:#4A6070;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:32px;}
.hero-p em{font-style:italic;color:#3A7A9B;}
.cta-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.btn-primary{background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#6FAACB;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #9DCBE4;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}

/* ── FINANCIAL CARD ── */
.fcard{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #B8D4E8;box-shadow:0 6px 32px rgba(42,90,122,.14);}
.fcard-hdr{background:#4A7A9B;padding:14px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
.fcard-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:white;letter-spacing:.02em;font-family:Georgia,serif;}
.fcard-step{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-style:italic;font-family:Georgia,serif;}
.fcard-body{background:#3D6880;padding:20px;}
.bubble{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-family:Georgia,serif;}
.bubble strong{color:white;font-weight:600;}
.scenarios-box{background:#F0F7FB;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;}
.sc-lbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6A8A9A;margin-bottom:10px;}
.sc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;}
.sc-a{background:#EEF5E8;border-radius:6px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #C8D8CD;}
.sc-b{background:white;border-radius:6px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;}
.sc-val{font-size:22px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:4px;font-family:Georgia,serif;}
.sc-note{font-size:10px;}

/* ── SECTIONS ── */
.sec-wrap{padding:56px 48px;max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;}
.sec-eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FAACB;margin-bottom:14px;}
.sec-h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:400;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.18;}
.sec-h2 em{color:#6FAACB;font-style:italic;}
.sec-sub{font-size:21px;color:#5A7A8A;line-height:1.8;}
.sec-sub em{font-style:italic;color:#3A7A9B;}
.bg-white{background:#fff;}
.bg-blue{background:#E8F4FA;}
.full-sec{width:100%;}

/* ── 6 STEPS ── */
.steps-inner{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;}
.steps-note{font-size:17px;color:#6FAACB;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-top:32px;letter-spacing:.04em;}

/* ── VALUE PROPS ── */
.v-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
.vcard{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;border:1px solid #D0E8F5;}
.vcard-hl{background:#ffffff;border-color:#D0E8F5;}
.v-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:#CFE6F3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.v-title{font-size:21px;font-weight:600;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:10px;}
.v-desc{font-size:17px;color:#5A7A8A;line-height:1.7;}

/* ── BLOG ── */
.blog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
.blog-card{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #E0EEF5;text-decoration:none;display:block;}
.blog-card:hover{border-color:#9DCBE4;}
.blog-img{height:172px;object-fit:cover;width:100%;display:block;background:#CFE6F3;}
.blog-body{padding:18px;}
.blog-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2A5A7A;background:#E8F4FA;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.blog-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:#1A2A35;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:8px;}
.blog-date{font-size:13px;color:#9BAAB5;}

/* ── COMMUNITY ── */
.comm-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#CFE6F3;color:#2A5A7A;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:22px;}
.comm-live{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#5FC87A;flex-shrink:0;}
.comm-posts{background:white;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #B8D4E8;overflow:hidden;margin:28px 0;}
.cp{padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #E8F2F8;}
.cp:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.cp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.cp-av{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#9DCBE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:white;flex-shrink:0;}
.cp-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#1A2A35;}
.cp-time{font-size:13px;color:#9BAAB5;margin-left:auto;}
.cp-text{font-size:17px;color:#4A6070;line-height:1.7;}
.cp-react{font-size:13px;color:#9BAAB5;margin-top:10px;}

/* ── TESTIMONIALS ── */
.test-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}
.tcard{background:#F7FBFD;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #E0EEF5;}
.stars{color:#6FAACB;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:3px;}
.tquote{font-size:19px;color:#4A6070;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:14px;font-style:italic;}
.tauthor{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#6FAACB;}

/* ── FOOTER ── */
.footer-nav-bar{background:#9DCBE4;width:100%;padding:14px 48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:36px;}
.footer-nav-bar a{font-size:16px;color:white;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.footer-nav-bar a:first-child{font-style:italic;font-weight:600;}
.footer-nav-bar a:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);}
.footer-logo-bar{background:white;width:100%;padding:18px 48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #EDF4F8;}
.footer-logo{height:72px;mix-blend-mode:multiply;display:block;}
.footer-legal{font-size:15px;color:#9BAAB5;}

.cta-btn{position:fixed;top:22px;right:32px;z-index:200;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.15);}
.cta-btn:hover{background:#5A9ABB;}

@media(max-width:960px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:40px 24px;}
  .sec-wrap{padding:40px 24px;}
  .v-grid,.blog-grid,.test-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .footer-nav-bar,.footer-logo-bar{padding:14px 24px;}
}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .nav-logo-bar{padding:10px 20px;}
  .nav-logo{height:52px!important;}
  .cta-btn{top:14px;right:16px;font-size:13px;padding:8px 14px;}
  .hero{padding:32px 20px;gap:24px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:2rem;}
  .sec-h2{font-size:1.8rem;}
  .blog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .cta-btn{display:none;}
  .hero h1{font-size:1.7rem;}
  .sec-h2{font-size:1.5rem;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- LOGO BAR -->
<div class="nav-logo-bar">
  <a href="/"><img class="nav-logo" src="/yda-logo.png" alt="Your Divorce Angel"></a>
</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<a class="cta-btn" href="https://divorcetracker.netlify.app">Get Started →</a>
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="https://divorcetracker.netlify.app" style="color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-style:italic;"><em>Your Divorce Angel</em></a>
    <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
    <a href="/toolkit/">Toolkit</a>
    <a href="/community/">Community</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- 1. HERO -->
<section class="bg-white full-sec">
  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">AI-guided divorce system</div>
      <h1>Stop wondering<br>what to do next.<br><em>Your Angel<br>knows.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-p"><em>Your Divorce Angel</em> is an AI-powered system that organises your complete financial picture, runs real settlement scenarios, and prepares you for every negotiation based on your location. You will spend less on lawyers, know what to fight for, and never agree to something you'll regret.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="https://divorcetracker.netlify.app">Get my financial picture &rarr;</a>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard">
      <div class="fcard-hdr">
        <div class="fcard-title">Your Financial Analysis</div>
        <div class="fcard-step">Step 2 of 6 &middot; Your Divorce Angel</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fcard-body">
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:5px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:0;">
          <div style="background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;"><div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8fa8b8;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1;">TOTAL ASSETS</div><div style="font-size:18px;color:#1A2A35;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$760k</div></div>
          <div style="background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;"><div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8fa8b8;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1;">TOTAL DEBTS</div><div style="font-size:18px;color:#C53030;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$328k</div></div>
          <div style="background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;"><div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8fa8b8;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1;">NET WORTH</div><div style="font-size:18px;color:#1A2A35;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$431k</div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:0;">
          <div style="background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;"><div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8fa8b8;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1;">CASH FLOW</div><div style="font-size:18px;color:#1A2A35;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$3,240/mo</div></div>
          <div style="background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;"><div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8fa8b8;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1;">YOUR SHARE</div><div style="font-size:18px;color:#1A2A35;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$215k</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bubble">Based on your numbers, <strong>selling the home gives you $156,000 more liquidity</strong> than a buyout. Refinancing alone would consume 71% of your take-home &mdash; a risky position long-term.</div>
        <div class="bubble">Your <strong>pension split and HELOC are your two strongest negotiation points.</strong> Don't settle anything on the house until those are resolved.</div>
        <div class="scenarios-box">
          <div class="sc-lbl">Settlement scenarios</div>
          <div class="sc-grid">
            <div class="sc-a"><div style="color:#1A2A35;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">Scenario A &mdash; Sell home &#10003;</div><div class="sc-val" style="color:#1A2A35;">$215,900</div><div class="sc-note" style="color:#6A8A9F;font-style:italic;font-family:Georgia,serif;">Recommended by Angel</div></div>
            <div class="sc-b"><div style="color:#4A6878;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;">Scenario B &mdash; Buyout</div><div class="sc-val" style="color:#4A6878;">$158,400</div><div class="sc-note" style="color:#6A8A9F;font-style:italic;font-family:Georgia,serif;">$57,500 less</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="bg-blue full-sec" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="sec-wrap">
    <div class="steps-inner">
      <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FAACB;margin-bottom:12px;">How it works</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:42px;font-weight:400;color:#1A2A35;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:16px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;">From overwhelmed to <em style="color:#6FAACB;">prepared</em><br>in 6 easy steps</h2>
      <p style="font-size:19px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px;"><em>Your Divorce Angel</em> walks you through everything your lawyer, mediator, or court needs &mdash; all in one place.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">1</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">Enter your financial snapshot</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Assets, debts, income &amp; expenses — everything courts require</div></div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">2</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">Angel analyzes your situation</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Personalized guidance based on your finances, location &amp; family</div></div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">3</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">See real settlement scenarios</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Walk in prepared — know what to fight for in every meeting</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">4</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">Prepare for every negotiation</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Personalized checklist, lawyer questions &amp; ranked priorities</div></div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">5</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">Store &amp; track your documents</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Every document required, tailored to your jurisdiction</div></div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #D5E8F0;padding:18px;"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;color:white;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;">6</div><div style="font-size:15px;color:#1A2A35;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;">Understand any document</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.55;font-style:italic;">Plain-English explanations specific to your situation</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-note">Save time &middot; Save money &middot; Reduce stress</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. AI COACH -->
<section class="bg-white full-sec">
  <div class="sec-wrap">
    <p class="sec-eyebrow">Your AI Coach</p>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:700;color:#1A2A35;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:2px;">Ask anything.</h2>
    <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:42px;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:#6FAACB;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:22px;">Angel already knows your file.</div>
    <p style="font-size:19px;color:#4a6878;line-height:1.72;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:36px;">Alongside your financial analysis and settlement scenarios, <em>Your Divorce Angel</em> is available any time to answer your questions, explain your options, and help you prepare &mdash; with no judgment and no hourly rate.</p>
    <div style="background:#e8f2f8;border-radius:14px;border:.5px solid #b8d6e8;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:20px;">
      <div style="background:#d4e9f3;padding:13px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;border-bottom:.5px solid #b8d6e8;">
        <div style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#6FAACB;flex-shrink:0;"></div>
        <div style="font-size:15px;font-style:italic;color:#1A2A35;opacity:.85;"><em>Your Divorce Angel</em></div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;font-style:italic;color:#6FAACB;margin-left:auto;">Live &middot; Ask me anything</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:20px 20px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
        <div style="align-self:flex-end;background:#ffffff;border:.5px solid #b8d6e8;border-radius:14px 14px 3px 14px;padding:11px 17px;max-width:62%;font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:#1A2A35;line-height:1.5;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);">Should I try to keep the house or sell it?</div>
        <div style="align-self:flex-start;background:#6b9fc0;border-radius:3px 14px 14px 14px;padding:14px 17px;max-width:74%;font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.96);line-height:1.72;">Based on your snapshot, <strong style="color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;">selling puts you $57,500 ahead</strong> of a buyout. With your income, carrying the mortgage alone would consume 68% of your take-home. I&rsquo;d fight for the sale and redirect that equity toward your retirement gap.</div>
        <div style="align-self:flex-end;background:#ffffff;border:.5px solid #b8d6e8;border-radius:14px 14px 3px 14px;padding:11px 17px;max-width:62%;font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:#1A2A35;line-height:1.5;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);">My husband says his 401(k) is all his. Is that true?</div>
        <div style="align-self:flex-start;background:#6b9fc0;border-radius:3px 14px 14px 14px;padding:14px 17px;max-width:74%;font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.96);line-height:1.72;">No. Contributions made during the marriage are <strong style="color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;">marital property</strong> in every US state. Based on your entries, you&rsquo;re entitled to approximately <strong style="color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;">$74,000</strong>. This is secured through a QDRO &mdash; don&rsquo;t leave this on the table.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:12px 20px 16px;border-top:.5px solid #c8dde8;background:rgba(255,255,255,.45);">
